w threat. This is a forcing move that requires White to play J6. Additionally, J7 is well-positioned relative to I7 and the empty K8 spot, offering better future connection possibilities than other forcing moves like M9 or H6.\n\nAnswer: {"col": "J", "row": 7}'}
